* SPICE Netlist for the Schematic

V1 2 3 DC 0 ; Input voltage source
R1 3 2 1k ; R1 connected between net 3 and 2
R2 4 2 1k ; R2 connected between net 4 and 2
C1 3 4 1uF ; Capacitor C connected between net 3 and 4
XOP 3 2 2 OPAMP ; Op-amp with input + at net 3, input - at net 2, output at net 2
.END